WEBVTT

00:11:00.196 --> 00:11:01.356
Yeah, so cool.

00:11:01.396 --> 00:11:05.636
(Applause)

00:11:05.676 --> 00:11:07.516
So how do we scale Tree Lab?

00:11:07.956 --> 00:11:09.316
The thing is,

00:11:09.356 --> 00:11:11.436
farmers are scaled already in Africa.

00:11:11.476 --> 00:11:13.356
These women work in farmer groups,

00:11:13.396 --> 00:11:17.516
so helping Asha actually helped
3,000 people in her village,

00:11:17.516 --> 00:11:21.196
because she shared the results
and also the solution.

00:11:21.676 --> 00:11:25.876
I remember every single
farmer I've ever met.

00:11:26.676 --> 00:11:30.236
Their pain and their joy